<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013), Zubkov et al. (2015) & Watanabe & Costantini (2004) kidney ureteric bud GDNF-RET-Wnt11 Turing branching morphogenesis with stromal BMP4/7-Gremlin1-FGF7 feedback and reduced-3D ampulla necking — Code-to-model traceability: 89/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring (L1-67) maps every section to its source equations and the Pass 3 additions name their functions, the Lean laws and the honesty control; the math-KG loop file registers Laws 4 and 5 with Lean declarations, variables, roles and `code_locus` line ranges (`menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.yaml`, L93-129); the Lean file's Law 4/5 headers state the Python function each theorem formalises (L159-205); `solve_ampulla_cap_imex` carries an explicit HONESTY NOTE about the seeded staircase (L342-346) and the removed hand-placed buds are documented in place (L756). Deductions: the calibration constants `gain_wt_ref`, `g_ref`, `size_jitter_sd` (L726-728), `R_TIP_WT_DEFAULT`, `TIP_RADIUS_SIGNAL_EXPONENT` (L102-103), the Gaussian amplitudes/widths (L774-789) and the saturating cubic (L403) are flagged as model choices but cite no derivation (-5); `compute_turing_phase_space` is dead code with a nonsensical `sigma_proxy` (L297-301) (-3); Lean Law 3 `tip_splitting_peaks` (L122) caps at m = 3 while the Python band map has a 4th polydomain band (-2); the math-KG `code_locus` ranges will drift as the script is edited (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py L297–L301: Dead sigma_proxy expression multiplies a term by 0.0; compute_turing_phase_space never called <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py#L297-L301>",
        "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_054_kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret.lean L122–L126: tip_splitting_peaks caps at 3 peaks; the m = 4 polydomain band has no Lean coverage <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_054_kidney_ureteric_bud_gdnf_ret.lean#L122-L126>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013), Zubkov et al. (2015) & Watanabe & Costantini (2004) kidney ureteric bud GDNF-RET-Wnt11 Turing branching morphogenesis with stromal BMP4/7-Gremlin1-FGF7 feedback and reduced-3D ampulla necking — Model fidelity to source: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The core Menshykau & Iber (2013) receptor-ligand system (steady state, flux cancellation, dispersion relation, lambda_c = 0.4726) is implemented correctly (L163-270) and the three Pass 3 additions are genuine mechanisms rather than relabelled prescriptions: the stromal gain law is a monotone BMP/Gremlin1/FGF7 function (L649-667) whose spatial fields (L774-789) set the per-tip ampulla radius and hence rho_tip and the splitting multiplicity (L835-852), the moving boundary advances the dome with the JSON growth law v_n = v0 max(0, R^2 G - S_thr) and re-solves the cap PDE on the current arc (L587-647), and the axis-selection argument compares Re sigma(2 pi/L) along the two principal arcs (L491-537). Deductions: the band-seeded cap solver seeds the cosine mode of the band-predicted m (L367-378), so the m = 1..4 staircase is an initial-condition artefact, and the noise-seeded control (L380-383) selects [2, 3, 5, 5] because the two-lobe mode sits on the rising flank of sigma(k) (-6); the hypoplasia parameter set b = 0.45 has Tr J_0 > 0 and is outside the Turing regime, now labelled (L1204) but still used for the hypoplasia tree (-3); the moving boundary is 1D on the dome with no curvature/surface-tension term, no re-meshing and no 3D, and the 90 deg dihedral rests on `daughter_long_axis_parallel` (L544, L569) rather than dynamics (-3); the cap kinetics use a saturating cubic R^2 G/(1 + 0.18 (R - R*)^2) (L403) that is not in the paper (-2); BMP4/BMP7 share one quasi-static field and `compute_turing_phase_space` (L272-310) is dead code with a term multiplied by 0.0 (L299) (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py L1204–L1204: Panel A labels the hypoplasia set b = 0.45 as Tr J_0 > 0, outside the Turing regime; the hypoplasia tree still uses it <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py#L1204-L1204>",
        "2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py L272–L310: compute_turing_phase_space is never called and sigma_proxy multiplies a term by 0.0 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py#L272-L310>",
        "2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py L367–L383: Band-seeded cosine initial condition for the predicted m versus the noise-seeded honesty control; the staircase is conditioned on its own seed <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py#L367-L383>" ;
